## Data Attribution

The material properties and technical data included in this application come from the following authoritative sources:

- **MatterHackers Filament Guide**: https://www.matterhackers.com/3d-printer-filament-compare
- **Simplify3D Materials Guide**: https://www.simplify3d.com/resources/materials-guide/
- **Polymaker Wiki**: https://wiki.polymaker.com/
- **CNC Kitchen**: https://www.cnckitchen.com/
- **Prusa Support**: https://help.prusa3d.com/en/category/materials_207
- **MatterHackers Blog**: https://www.matterhackers.com/articles

All material data is used in compliance with fair use principles for educational and reference purposes.

